[SPEAKER_00]: Well, yes.

361
00:32:20,054 --> 00:32:27,561
[SPEAKER_00]: So, any Buddhist contemplation can only be developed on the basis of already developed virtue and sense restraint.

362
00:32:29,443 --> 00:32:42,337
