[SPEAKER_00]: That's what needs to be developed first.

364
00:32:45,901 --> 00:32:54,922
[SPEAKER_00]: Because none of these... all of these contemplations will remain abstract if a person has not created the basis of virtue, the aggregate of virtue that I'm going to refer to.

