385
00:35:37,216 --> 00:35:39,959
[SPEAKER_00]: Because that's why people are so afraid of giving up sensual pleasures.

386
00:35:40,539 --> 00:35:42,902
[SPEAKER_00]: Because it feels like dying.

387
00:35:42,922 --> 00:35:45,785
[SPEAKER_00]: So, you want to contemplate death?

388
00:35:46,326 --> 00:35:53,313
[SPEAKER_00]: Keep the eight precepts, don't act out of sensuality, endure your mind, and you're gonna have a first-hand experience of fading away.

389
00:36:01,379 --> 00:36:08,344
[SPEAKER_01]: I have a small question about the choices of the words that we use when we talk about contemplation.

390
00:36:08,364 --> 00:36:13,168
