391
00:36:13,748 --> 00:36:14,629
[SPEAKER_01]: Is this, like, the same?

392
00:36:14,849 --> 00:36:17,251
[SPEAKER_01]: Would it mean the same thing or is there a difference to it?

393
00:36:17,711 --> 00:36:18,292
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, I don't know.

394
00:36:18,512 --> 00:36:19,853
[SPEAKER_00]: I guess it could mean... depends, really.

395
00:36:21,374 --> 00:36:25,097
[SPEAKER_00]: I think you just have to explain what you mean by each term and then see if they correspond to you.

396
00:36:27,374 --> 00:36:35,920
